{"seq":1,"slug":"rare-item-stock-consistency","title":"稀有款库存与概率一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/probability-inventory/rare-item-stock-consistency","wordCount":1575,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"稀有款库存与概率一致\">稀有款库存与概率一致</h1><p>概率表说隐藏款占 1%，库存系统里有 500 件隐藏款，这两句话必须同时为真才成立。一旦概率与库存脱节，会出现两种截然不同的故障：概率说 1% 但库存只够支撑 0.3%，抽到该层的请求无货可发；或者库存充足但概率表被调低，实物积压在仓里。前者是履约事故，后者是资金占用事故。这一篇讲的是把概率与库存绑定成同一个约束系统的做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-概率是需求-库存是供给\">核心概念：概率是需求，库存是供给</h2><p>把概率表理解为<strong>需求侧</strong>的流量分布：给定预计销量，每层的出货量是可计算的。库存是<strong>供给侧</strong>的实物数量。两者的关系是一个简单的恒等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>预计出货</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>预计销量</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mtext>库存</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{预计出货}_i = \\text{预计销量} \\times p_i \\le \\text{库存}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预计出货</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预计销量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">库存</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个恒等式看似平凡，实际约束很强：它意味着概率表不能独立于库存被修改，任何权重调整都必须重新验证所有层位的供给是否足够。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[概率表权重] --&gt; B[预计出货量]&#10;  C[实际销量] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; D{每层供给校验}&#10;  E[库存台账] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|充足| F[放行发售]&#10;  D --&gt;|不足| G[调整权重或补货]&#10;  G --&gt; A&#10;  D --&gt;|隐藏款不足| H[下架该层并升版]\">graph TD\n  A[概率表权重] --&gt; B[预计出货量]\n  C[实际销量] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; D{每层供给校验}\n  E[库存台账] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|充足| F[放行发售]\n  D --&gt;|不足| G[调整权重或补货]\n  G --&gt; A\n  D --&gt;|隐藏款不足| H[下架该层并升版]</pre><p>图上有两条回边，指向两种修法：调权重是软修，补货是硬修。隐藏款不足时还有第三种修法——把它从概率表中移除并升版，因为空缺的层位不应继续出现在明示页面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概率与库存的绑定校验\">概率与库存的绑定校验</h2><p>校验必须在配置发布前执行，而不是在抽取运行时才发现。运行时发现的代价是用户体验受损且无法回滚已发生的抽取。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预计出货量的计算口径\">预计出货量的计算口径</h3><p>计算需要三个输入：预计销量、概率表版本、以及每层的最大可出货量。预计销量不应取最乐观值，而应取经营预算的中位数或历史同系列的实际值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE tier_stock_budget (&#10;  series_id   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  version     INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  tier        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  stock_units INT  NOT NULL CHECK (stock_units &gt;= 0),&#10;  forecast_units BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (series_id, version, tier)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 每层供给缺口：预计出货量超过库存即为缺口&#10;SELECT b.series_id, b.version, b.tier,&#10;       ROUND(b.forecast_units * w.weight::numeric / SUM(w.weight) OVER (PARTITION BY b.series_id, b.version), 0)&#10;         AS expected_units,&#10;       b.stock_units,&#10;       GREATEST(&#10;         ROUND(b.forecast_units * w.weight::numeric / SUM(w.weight) OVER (PARTITION BY b.series_id, b.version), 0)&#10;           - b.stock_units, 0) AS shortfall&#10;FROM tier_stock_budget b&#10;JOIN series_probability w&#10;  ON w.series_id = b.series_id AND w.version = b.version AND w.tier = b.tier&#10;WHERE ROUND(b.forecast_units * w.weight::numeric / SUM(w.weight) OVER (PARTITION BY b.series_id, b.version), 0)&#10;      &gt; b.stock_units;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tier_stock_budget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  series_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stock_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stock_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  forecast_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (series_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tier)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每层供给缺口：预计出货量超过库存即为缺口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_units,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stock_units</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stock_units</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shortfall</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier_stock_budget b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_probability w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">series_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stock_units</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询返回的行就是不能发售的系列。把它做成发售门控的一部分，而不是运营每周手动对一次表，是概率与库存保持一致的最低成本做法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐藏款的特殊处理\">隐藏款的特殊处理</h3><p>隐藏款的供给校验比普通款严格，因为它通常不是按销量比例生产，而是固定批量。两个额外约束：<strong>保底需求</strong>（见 <a href=\"../probability-model-config/pity-guardian-pull-model\">保底/隐藏款与抽取模型</a>）会在最坏情况下集中消耗隐藏款，必须单独估算；<strong>复刻与补货</strong>（见 <a href=\"series-reissue-rotation\">系列发售/复刻/轮换</a>）会分多次投放同一层的库存，汇总口径要覆盖全部批次而不是单批。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽取时的库存扣减\">抽取时的库存扣减</h2><p>配置校验解决的是「量级是否匹配」，运行时扣减解决的是「并发下不出错」。难点在于扣减必须与抽取判定、账本写入保持强一致。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[抽取判定得到层位] --&gt; B[按层位选择候选 SKU]&#10;  B --&gt; C[条件扣减 UPDATE ... WHERE qty &gt;= 1]&#10;  C --&gt;|影响 1 行| D[写抽取记录]&#10;  C --&gt;|影响 0 行| E[层内换 SKU 重试]&#10;  E --&gt;|仍无货| F[降级到次高层并记录]&#10;  D --&gt; G[异步补货告警]\">graph TD\n  A[抽取判定得到层位] --&gt; B[按层位选择候选 SKU]\n  B --&gt; C[条件扣减 UPDATE ... WHERE qty &gt;= 1]\n  C --&gt;|影响 1 行| D[写抽取记录]\n  C --&gt;|影响 0 行| E[层内换 SKU 重试]\n  E --&gt;|仍无货| F[降级到次高层并记录]\n  D --&gt; G[异步补货告警]</pre><p>分岔点在「影响 0 行」：条件扣减失败说明并发抢走了最后一件。此时应在<strong>同层内</strong>换 SKU 重试，而不是直接跨层降级——跨层降级会改变实际出货分布，使实际概率偏离公示值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"条件扣减与超发防护\">条件扣减与超发防护</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE tier_inventory&#10;SET available = available - 1, updated_at = now()&#10;WHERE series_id = $1 AND tier = $2 AND sku = $3 AND available &gt;= 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier_inventory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> series_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>单条语句完成判定与扣减，<code>available &gt;= 1</code> 是并发安全的边界条件。绝不能写成先 <code>SELECT available</code> 再判断再 <code>UPDATE</code>——那会引入经典的丢失更新（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-select.html\">PostgreSQL SELECT</a>）。若扣减之后还要做多步操作（校验、记账、通知），把它包进一个 <code>SERIALIZABLE</code> 事务比逐条加锁更稳，代价是可能返回 SQLSTATE <code>40001</code> 序列化失败并要求重试（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/transaction-iso.html\">PostgreSQL 事务隔离</a>）。重试必须是幂等的——同一抽取请求重试两次不能扣两次库存，这就是为什么下文要求抽取带幂等键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨层降级的一致性代价\">跨层降级的一致性代价</h3><p>当整个层位无货时，系统只能降级或拒单。降级会破坏公示概率，拒单会破坏成交。可行做法是<strong>发售前就把该层从概率表移除并升版</strong>，让降级成为不该发生的异常路径；若异常路径仍被触发，必须记录降级次数并纳入审计，因为它直接影响实际出货分布与公示值的一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库存与概率的持续对齐\">库存与概率的持续对齐</h2><p>一次校验通过不等于永远一致。销量偏离预期、退款回滚库存、补货延迟、以及抽取并发异常，都会让实际状态偏离配置假设。</p>\n<h3 id=\"偏离的监控指标\">偏离的监控指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>触发动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>层位消耗率</td>\n<td>实际出货量 / 库存</td>\n<td>超过阈值预警补货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级次数</td>\n<td>因无货跨层降级的次数</td>\n<td>大于 0 即告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剩余可支撑天数</td>\n<td>库存 / 近期日均出货</td>\n<td>低于补货周期即下单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率库存偏差</td>\n<td>实际出货占比 与 公示概率 之差</td>\n<td>显著偏离即冻结发售</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一个指标是概率与库存一致性的总闸。它与随机数审计里的分布偏差检测同源，但关注点不同：审计关注「抽取是否公平」，这个指标关注「供给是否跟得上」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退款与退货的库存回补\">退款与退货的库存回补</h3><p>退款回补常被忽略的细节是<strong>回补到哪一层</strong>。若退还的是隐藏款，回补的是隐藏款库存，不应回补到普通款。若退还时该层已经从概率表移除，回补的库存无法被抽取消耗，只能进入次轮发售或线下渠道——这种库存应当在系统里被标记为孤立库存，避免它永远挂在账上而被反复计入可售量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>概率是需求侧流量分布，库存是供给侧实物，二者由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>预计出货</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mtext>库存</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{预计出货}_i \\le \\text{库存}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预计出货</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">库存</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 绑定。</li>\n<li>供给校验应作为发售门控，而非运营的定期人工动作。</li>\n<li>扣减必须用条件 <code>UPDATE ... WHERE available &gt;= 1</code> 单语句完成，避免丢失更新。</li>\n<li>层内换 SKU 重试是允许的，跨层降级会破坏公示概率，应作为异常路径记录并审计。</li>\n<li>隐藏款需单独估算保底需求与多批次投放，供给校验口径要覆盖全部批次。</li>\n<li>退款回补须回到原层位，已下架层位回补的库存应标记为孤立库存。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稀有款库存与概率一致","id":"稀有款库存与概率一致"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：概率是需求，库存是供给","id":"核心概念-概率是需求-库存是供给"},{"level":2,"text":"概率与库存的绑定校验","id":"概率与库存的绑定校验"},{"level":3,"text":"预计出货量的计算口径","id":"预计出货量的计算口径"},{"level":3,"text":"隐藏款的特殊处理","id":"隐藏款的特殊处理"},{"level":2,"text":"抽取时的库存扣减","id":"抽取时的库存扣减"},{"level":3,"text":"条件扣减与超发防护","id":"条件扣减与超发防护"},{"level":3,"text":"跨层降级的一致性代价","id":"跨层降级的一致性代价"},{"level":2,"text":"库存与概率的持续对齐","id":"库存与概率的持续对齐"},{"level":3,"text":"偏离的监控指标","id":"偏离的监控指标"},{"level":3,"text":"退款与退货的库存回补","id":"退款与退货的库存回补"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保底/隐藏款与抽取模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/probability-model-config/pity-guardian-pull-model"},"next":{"title":"抽取/兑换/集卡合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/probability-inventory/draw-redeem-compose"}}